repository-code: "https://github.com/itpplasma/stafford38-formal"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of Stafford's Conjecture 3.8. For every
  characteristic-zero field, every Weyl-algebra rank, and every nonzero d, it
  proves the existence of F, R, and S satisfying 1 = dR + FdS. It also proves
  an exact Bernstein-degree fixed-source strengthening, the general
  tangent-limit, asymptotic-conormal and coisotropic-exclusion theorems, and
  localization, adjoint, differential-operator, evolutionary, and tensor
  corollaries. Every endpoint depends only on the axioms propext,
  Classical.choice and Quot.sound.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - Mathlib
  - Weyl algebra
  - Stafford's conjecture
  - noncommutative algebra
  - D-module
  - characteristic variety
  - formal mathematics
